# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files.
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true checks files out as CRLF on Windows, which
# conflicts with Biome's LF formatter and makes `bun run lint` fail unless every
# file is rewritten before each commit. Enforcing LF in the repo and on checkout
# keeps the working tree, the blobs, and Biome in agreement.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
